## Decisions

@decision
Title: One directive syntax for everything
Why:
Two syntaxes would mean two grammars, two escaping rules and two places for
implementations to disagree. One syntax means a new feature is a new name.
Date: 2026-07-29
@enddecision

@decision
Title: Unknown directives are warnings, never errors
Why: A reader from today must stay useful on a document written tomorrow.
Date: 2026-07-29
@enddecision

